1
00:00:00,418 --> 00:00:03,258
(Man:)You know, if you ask nicely, they'll
let you visit the engine room.

2
00:00:04,489 --> 00:00:06,729
(Sheldon:)I never want this day to end.

3
00:00:06,891 --> 00:00:08,491
(Amy:)It's feeling like it never will.

4
00:00:10,094 --> 00:00:11,404
(Amy:)Come on.

5
00:00:12,197 --> 00:00:15,077
(Man:)Hey, did I tell you what
happened to me at UPS?

6
00:00:17,835 --> 00:00:21,405
(Raj:)As if Valentine's Day wasn't bad
enough, you try to kill my dog?!

7
00:00:21,573 --> 00:00:23,573
(Raj:)And with cheap chocolate, no less?

8
00:00:23,741 --> 00:00:26,691
(Penny:)It wasn't cheap.
It was free.

9
00:00:27,946 --> 00:00:29,616
(Leonard:)We're really sorry.
It was an accident.

10
00:00:29,781 --> 00:00:31,381
(Penny:)Yeah, we weren't even out
of the room that long.

11
00:00:31,549 --> 00:00:33,859
(Leonard:)No, come on. It was a while.

12
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,130
(Leonard:)It was a while.

13
00:00:39,691 --> 00:00:42,361
-Is Cinnamon gonna be OK?
-She's responding well.

14
00:00:42,527 --> 00:00:44,977
(Vet:)We just want to keep her
a little longer for observation.

15
00:00:45,129 --> 00:00:47,439
All right. Would it be OK
for me to see her?

16
00:00:47,599 --> 00:00:50,479
(Raj:)We're usually in bed by now,
and I want her to know that I'm here.

17
00:00:51,869 --> 00:00:54,279
(Raj:)Yes, we sleep together,
and sometimes we spoon.

18
00:00:57,108 --> 00:01:00,018
It's OK. I sleep with my dog, too.

